+"""Verified generator for sparse congruence normalizers of PSD Gram matrices.
+
+The source is Definition 1 and Lemma 17 of arXiv:1407.4308.  Lemma 17
+normalizes the sum C of PSD factors by a congruence V C V^T = I.  This module
+inverse-generates positive-definite rational Gram matrices that have a hidden
+scaled covariance-chain order.  The requested permutation is a compact exact
+encoding of the sparse first-difference normalizer V.
+
+Generation samples the order and a rational Gram representation first; it
+never recovers a normalizer from the completed instance.  Verification expands
+the submitted encoding and checks the congruence exactly over Q.
+"""
+
+from __future__ import annotations
