        "Track B: Gauss-Jordan inversion over GF(2) is an O(n^3) exact "
        "algorithm; at shipping n=15 it averaged 2,250 scalar XORs and "
        "0.00008 seconds over eight seeds, while the rank-one-plus-block "
        "route uses at most 289 exact bit operations."
    ),
    "max_answer_tokens": 123,
}

