codex
The fixed-length redesign now passes all local gates. At shipping size it presents 201 matched \(6\times6\) bilinear forms, has exactly one valid index/inverse pair, and keeps the answer to 37 atoms (about 28 tokens). Sequential elimination averages 14,990 scalar XORs, while the component-parity route is conservatively capped at exactly 300 operations. I’m rerunning the bare oracle ladder on this stronger distribution.
