+`1^T D^-1 1=0`, and then
 
 ```text
-(D + 11^T)^-1 = D^-1 + (D^-1 1)(1^T D^-1)       over GF(2).
+(D + 11^T)^-1 = D^-1 + (D^-1 1)(1^T D^-1).
